MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 16
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 12
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 QS_Start
HSTORE TEMP 3 4 QS_Sort
HSTORE TEMP 3 8 QS_Print
HSTORE TEMP 3 12 QS_Init
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 11 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 10 )
END

QS_Start [ 2 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 2 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 3 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 12
RETURN TEMP 5
END ( TEMP 3 TEMP 1 )

MOVE TEMP 2 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 8
RETURN TEMP 8
END ( TEMP 6 )

PRINT 9999

MOVE TEMP 2 MINUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 8
RETURN TEMP 9
END
 1

MOVE TEMP 2 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 11 4
RETURN TEMP 12
END ( TEMP 10 0 TEMP 2 )

MOVE TEMP 2 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 13 0
HLOAD TEMP 15 TEMP 14 8
RETURN TEMP 15
END ( TEMP 13 )

RETURN 0
END

QS_Sort [ 3 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 7 0
CJUMP LE TEMP 1 TEMP 2 L3
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 2 L5
 L5 CJUMP NE TEMP 1 TEMP 2 L3
CJUMP MINUS 1 NE TEMP 1 TEMP 2 L2

 
L2 
MOVE TEMP 3 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 12 PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 11
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 2
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 12 4
RETURN TEMP 13
END



MOVE TEMP 4 MINUS TEMP 1 1


MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 2


MOVE TEMP 8 1

L6	CJUMP TEMP 8 L8
CJUMP MINUS 1 TEMP 8 L7

L7	
MOVE TEMP 9 1

L9	CJUMP TEMP 9 L11
CJUMP MINUS 1 TEMP 9 L10

L10	
MOVE TEMP 4 PLUS TEMP 4 1


MOVE TEMP 10 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 15 PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 14
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 4
HLOAD TEMP 16 TEMP 15 4
RETURN TEMP 16
END


CJUMP LE TEMP 10 MINUS TEMP 3 1 L12
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 10 MINUS TEMP 3 1 L13
 
L12 
