 JUMP L14
L13 
MOVE TEMP 9 1

L14 NOOP


JUMP L9
L11	NOOP


MOVE TEMP 9 1

L15	CJUMP TEMP 9 L17
CJUMP MINUS 1 TEMP 9 L16

L16	
MOVE TEMP 5 MINUS TEMP 5 1


MOVE TEMP 10 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 18 PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 17 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 17
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 19 TEMP 18 4
RETURN TEMP 19
END


CJUMP LE TEMP 3 MINUS TEMP 10 1 L18
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 3 MINUS TEMP 10 1 L19
 
L18 
MOVE TEMP 9 0
 JUMP L20
L19 
MOVE TEMP 9 1

L20 NOOP


JUMP L15
L17	NOOP


MOVE TEMP 7 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 21 PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 20 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 20
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 4
HLOAD TEMP 22 TEMP 21 4
RETURN TEMP 22
END



HSTORE PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 23 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 23
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 4 4 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 25 PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 24 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 24
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 26 TEMP 25 4
RETURN TEMP 26
END



HSTORE PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 27 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 27
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 5 4 TEMP 7

CJUMP LE TEMP 5 TEMP 4 L22
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 5 TEMP 4 L21
 
L21 
MOVE TEMP 8 0
 JUMP L23
L22 
MOVE TEMP 8 1

L23 NOOP


JUMP L6
L8	NOOP


HSTORE PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 28 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 28
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 5 4 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 30 PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 29 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 29
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 4
HLOAD TEMP 31 TEMP 30 4
RETURN TEMP 31
END



HSTORE PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 32 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 32
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 4 4 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 34 PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 33 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 33
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 2
HLOAD TEMP 35 TEMP 34 4
RETURN TEMP 35
END



HSTORE PLUS BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 36 TEMP 0 4
RETURN TEMP 36
END
 TIMES 4 TEMP 2 4 TEMP 7


MOVE TEMP 6 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 37 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 38 TEMP 37 0
HLOAD TEMP 39 TEMP 38 4
RETURN TEMP 39
END ( TEMP 37 TEMP 1 MINUS TEMP 4 1 )


MOVE TEMP 6 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 40 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 41 TEMP 40 0
HLOAD TEMP 42 TEMP 41 4
RETURN TEMP 42
END ( TEMP 40 PLUS TEMP 4 1 TEMP 2 )

 JUMP L4
L3 
